      Play Games Services App ID from Play Console > Grow > Play Games Services.
      Must stay a string resource, not a Gradle manifest placeholder: AAPT
      auto-types a purely-numeric placeholder value as an Integer, and the
      games.APP_ID meta-data silently rejects anything that isn't a String
      (confirmed on-device: "expected String but value was a java.lang.Integer").
      A placeholder - sign-in will not work until this is a real app ID.
    -->
